E-LEADING-ZERO 5:9-5:12 Whole numbers can't start with a zero.
E-IDENT-TOO-LONG 6:1-6:34 Names can be at most 32 characters. Try a shorter one.
E-MIXED-INDENT 9:1-9:3 These lines are indented by different amounts. Pick one (4 spaces is standard)."
